  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The LEAP programme seeks to extend social protection coverage and integrate systems that enhance service quality for children, youth, women, elderly and families. By investing in social protection&#x2014;currently at 9.6% of GDP compared to the EU average of 20.5%&#x2014;the programme aims to create a sustainable fiscal space for child-focused investments.ObjectivesExtended Coverage and Integrated Social Protection: To enhance the quality and accessibility of social protection services for children and famili</narrative>
  </description>
